       "text": "I haven't entered this order. Amlodipine 50 mg is five times the maximum recommended adult dose of 10 mg once daily. The usual range is 2.5\u201310 mg. A dose that high risks severe hypotension, reflex tachycardia, and prolonged vasodilatory shock. Because of its long half-life, those effects can last for days.\n\nWas this a typo? Here are some options:\n- **5 mg orally once daily**, a standard starting dose.\n- **10 mg orally once daily**, the maximum dose.\n- **2.5 mg orally once daily**, if the patient is frail or you want a more cautious start.\n\nIf 50 mg is intentional, please confirm that and give the clinical rationale. I can then enter it with a note recording that you confirmed the dose. Tell me which dose you'd like and I'll enter it."
